52
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:48,270
I don't know if you're aware, son, but there has been a lot of turmoil in the markets recently.

53
00:01:49,410 --> 00:01:56,730
There have already been half a million layoffs in the last few months, and we have no idea how the proposed stimulus package will impact upon the economy.

54
00:01:57,390 --> 00:01:58,490
There's just too much instability.

55
00:01:59,410 --> 00:02:01,590
I just wouldn't feel comfortable investing in this climate.

56
