You know, I'm tired of hearing all this news about the economic downturn, the inevitable recession, people stuffing their money in their mattresses.

150
00:06:51,140 --> 00:06:52,200
I look at this as an opportunity.

151
00:06:52,840 --> 00:06:55,240
This is a chance for me to get a jumpstart on building my nest egg.

152
00:06:55,540 --> 00:06:56,520
I don't know about that.

153
00:06:56,960 --> 00:07:00,360
With all the uncertainty in the markets right now, it would be a very unwise decision to invest.

154
00:07:01,200 --> 00:07:05,000
I don't know if you're aware, son, but there has been a lot of turmoil in the markets recently.

155
00:07:06,150 --> 00:07:13,470
There have already been half a million layoffs in the last few months, and we have no idea how the proposed stimulus package will impact upon the economy.

156
