No, you're not going to go up to your boss and say, hey, I need to hit you up for some cash.

214
00:09:59,120 --> 00:09:59,280
No.

215
00:09:59,640 --> 00:10:03,320
So Marco, I think this word is only applying to money, right?

216
00:10:03,700 --> 00:10:08,140
Well, you wouldn't go up to your boss and say, oh, I need to hit you up for some vacation time.

217
00:10:08,340 --> 00:10:10,380
No, it's typically used like for money.

218
00:10:10,680 --> 00:10:11,080
In this context.

219
00:10:11,680 --> 00:10:12,680
Yeah.

220
00:10:12,680 --> 00:10:13,680
Yeah.

221
00:10:13,680 --> 00:10:14,680
Hit him up.

222
00:10:14,680 --> 00:10:15,680
We've got some examples of the phrase hit up.

223
00:10:15,680 --> 00:10:15,880
Let's listen.

224
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,400
Example one.

225
00:10:19,980 --> 00:10:21,360
I'm going to hit up the boss for a raise.

226
00:10:25,160 --> 00:10:25,420
Example two.

227
00:10:28,170 --> 00:10:29,490
Are you trying to hit me up for money?

228
00:10:32,800 --> 00:10:33,700
Example three.

229
